## monocyte specific signatures 

With the exclusive signatures, the Ccr2 and inflammatory monocyte scores are not correlated. And despite the Ccr2 signature being much fewer genes relative to the "same" (the genes shared between the Ccr2 and the inflammatory monocytes DGE) and the inflammatory monocyte signature, it correlates with the "same" monocyte signature, and not with the inflammatory monocyte signature. 



